#: ../../api/palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.rst:2
msgid "Viewer3DWidget"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget:1
msgid "Widget d'affichage 3D pour Napari permettant de charger un fichier CSV et de visualiser les points en 3D avec ajustements interactifs des échelles et de la taille des points."
msgstr "A 3D display widget for Napari that allows you to load a CSV file and view points in 3D with interactive adjustments to the X, Y, and Z scales and point size."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget:4
msgid "Ce widget ajoute dans le dock de Napari :"
msgstr "This widget adds the following to the Napari dock:"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget:5
msgid "un bouton de chargement de fichier CSV,"
msgstr "a button to load a CSV file,"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget:6
msgid "trois champs pour contrôler les échelles en XY et Z et la taille des points,"
msgstr "three fields to control the XY and Z scales and the point size,"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget:7
msgid "une option permettant d'exclure les points avec intensité nulle,"
msgstr "an option to exclude points with zero intensity,"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget:8
msgid "un calque Napari Points mis à jour dynamiquement."
msgstr "a dynamically updated Napari Points layer."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget:10
msgid "Le CSV doit contenir les colonnes ``X``, ``Y``, ``Z`` et ``Integrated Intensity``."
msgstr "The CSV must contain the columns ``X``, ``Y``, ``Z``, and ``Integrated Intensity``."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget:1
msgid "Widget d'affichage 3D pour un viewer Napari."
msgstr "3D display widget for a Napari viewer."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget:3
msgid "Ce widget permet :"
msgstr "This widget allows you to:"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget:4
msgid "de charger un fichier CSV contenant des coordonnées 3D"
msgstr "load a CSV file containing 3D coordinates"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget:5
msgid "d'ajuster l'échelle XY et Z"
msgstr "adjust the XY and Z scales"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget:6
msgid "de modifier la taille des points"
msgstr "change the size of the points"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget:7
msgid "d'activer ou non la suppression des points d'intensité nulle"
msgstr "enable or disable the removal of points with zero intensity"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget:8
msgid "de créer ou mettre à jour un calque de type :class:`napari.layers.Points`."
msgstr "create or update a layer of type :class:`napari.layers.Points`."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget:10
msgid "**Remarque** : peut être lancé directement avec la commande ``napari -w palm-tracer \"Viewer 3D\"``"
msgstr "**Note**: Can be launched directly with the command ``napari -w palm-tracer \"Viewer 3D\"``"

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.rst
msgid "Paramètres"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget:12
msgid "Instance du viewer Napari où sera ajouté le calque 3D."
msgstr "Instance of the Napari viewer to which the 3D layer will be added."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.load_csv:1
msgid "Ouvre une boîte de dialogue pour sélectionner un fichier ``.csv`` et charge les données associées dans un :class:`pandas.DataFrame`."
msgstr "Opens a dialog box to select a ``.csv`` file and loads the associated data into a :class:`pandas.DataFrame`."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.load_csv:3
msgid "Le fichier doit contenir les colonnes : ``\"X\"``, ``\"Y\"``, ``\"Z\"``, ``\"Integrated Intensity\"``"
msgstr "The file must contain the following columns: ``\"X\"``, ``\"Y\"``, ``\"Z\"``, ``\"Integrated Intensity\"``"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.load_csv:5
msgid "Si un calque existe déjà, il est supprimé avant la création du nouveau."
msgstr "If a layer already exists, it is deleted before the new one is created."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.load_csv:7
msgid "Cette méthode déclenche ensuite :meth:`update_layer` pour créer le calque 3D."
msgstr "This method then triggers :meth:`update_layer` to create the 3D layer."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.update_layer:1
msgid "Crée ou mets à jour le calque de points 3D dans le viewer Napari."
msgstr "Creates or updates the 3D point layer in the Napari viewer."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.update_layer:3
msgid "Transformations appliquées :"
msgstr "Applied transformations:"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.update_layer:4
msgid "réorganisation des coordonnées sous la forme ``(Z, Y, X)``"
msgstr "reorganization of coordinates into the form ``(Z, Y, X)``"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.update_layer:5
msgid "mise à l'échelle par les valeurs choisies dans les widgets"
msgstr "scaling based on the values selected in the widgets"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.update_layer:6
msgid "suppression éventuelle des points dont ``Integrated Intensity == 0``"
msgstr "possible removal of points where ``Integrated Intensity == 0``"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.update_layer:7
msgid "mise à jour dynamique du calque existant ou création d'un nouveau"
msgstr "dynamic update of the existing layer or creation of a new one"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.Viewer3DWidget.update_layer:9
msgid "Si aucune donnée n'est encore chargée, la méthode ne fait rien."
msgstr "If no data has been loaded yet, the method does nothing."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.create_viewer3d:1
msgid "Crée une nouvelle fenêtre Napari 3D, sans menu, et y ajoute le Viewer3DWidget docké à droite."
msgstr "Creates a new Napari 3D window, without a menu, and adds the Viewer3DWidget docked on the right."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.create_viewer3d:3
msgid "Cette fonction NE lance PAS napari.run() : elle est faite pour être appelée depuis un plugin, donc dans une appli Qt déjà active."
msgstr "This function does NOT call napari.run(): it is designed to be called from a plugin, i.e., within an already active Qt application."

#: ../../api/palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.rst of
#: palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.create_viewer3d
msgid "Type renvoyé"
msgstr "Return type"

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.open_viewer3d:1
msgid "Callable utilisé par Napari pour le menu Plugins > PALM Tracer > Viewer 3D."
msgstr "Callable used by Napari for the Plugins > PALM Tracer > Viewer 3D menu."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.open_viewer3d:3
msgid "Ignore le viewer courant."
msgstr "Ignores the current viewer."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.open_viewer3d:4
msgid "Crée une nouvelle fenêtre Napari 3D dédiée."
msgstr "Creates a new dedicated Napari 3D window."

#: of palm_tracer.UI.Viewer3DWidget.open_viewer3d:5
msgid "Retourne un QWidget stub (caché) juste pour satisfaire l'API \"widget plugin\" de Napari."
msgstr "Returns a stub QWidget (hidden) solely to satisfy Napari's \"widget plugin\" API."
